tutorial
Usage: tutorial

The first screen xos shows you, and where to start.

Three short pages -- where you are, how to run more than one thing at
once, and where to start -- then it points you at learn and gets out of
the way.

It runs by itself once per boot, on the first terminal you open. Type it
again anytime:

	tutorial

Press Enter for the next page; press q to leave early. It changes nothing
and asks nothing -- it only points.

Next: learn teaches every command from nothing, and once the encrypted
side of the stick is set up, arsenal learn teaches the field toolkit.
